# Rutherford, Upgraded Ensign: "When Rutherford enters, look at the top six cards of your library. You may reveal an artifact
# card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order." The six are
# the Ornithopter, the Grizzly Bears and four Islands; the Ornithopter is the one artifact, so it may be taken and the Bears
# may not. "Whenever you cast a Spacecraft spell, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature" (CR 603.2): casting the Ornithopter,
# an artifact but no Spacecraft, triggers nothing, and casting U.S.S. Excelsior does, putting the counter on the Ornithopter.

